ISA1 NET13 pull-up model: R tolerance, lumped C and worst sink leakage
VCC supply 0 5.5
RPU supply data 3135
CLOAD data 0 3e-11
ILEAK data 0 4.5e-06
VCTRL ctrl 0 PULSE(1 0 10n .1n .1n 5u 10u)
SLOW data 0 ctrl 0 SW
.model SW SW(Ron=.1 Roff=1e15 Vt=.5 Vh=0)
.tran .5n 5u
.meas tran vh FIND v(data) AT=4.9u
.meas tran rise1090 TRIG v(data) VAL=0.54858925 RISE=1 TARG v(data) VAL=4.93730325 RISE=1
.end
